#
# Counter-example for math:CycleShape (derived from the min-1 qualified restriction on
# math:Cycle's math:cycleOf): a math:Cycle naming no math:ChainComplex whose kernel of
# the boundary operator it lies in. Validation MUST emit
# shacl.QualifiedMinCountConstraintComponent (math:UngroundedCycle). math:Cycle also
# inherits math:Chain's math:chainOf obligation, so ex:bareCycle is additionally typed
# math:Chain and given a math:chainOf value to isolate the cycle-specific violation.
@prefix math: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/> .
@prefix ex:   <http://example.org/math/> .

ex:bareCycle a math:Cycle , math:Chain ;
    math:chainOf ex:complex .

ex:complex a math:ChainComplex .
